{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33872","headline":"奉和鲁望四明山九题 鞠侯 · 皮日休","name":"奉和鲁望四明山九题 鞠侯","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"堪羡鞠侯国，碧岩千万重。\n烟萝爲印绶，云壑是堤封。\n泉遣狙公护，果教𤟤子供\n尔徒如不死，应得蹑玄踪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33872.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33872","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}